    cat <<'EOF'

ERROR: MariaDB Data migration tool (sqldata) not found.

  Parallel Restartable Streaming Copy (sqldata) needs the 'sqldata' binary. Install it, then
  either put it on PATH or export SQLINESDATA_BIN=/path/to/sqldata before
  re-running:

      export SQLINESDATA_BIN=/opt/sqldata/sqldata
